:: Linkon University
<<initPlayState>>\
<<run World.setLocation("linkon-university", "Bloomshore District — Linkon University")>>\
<<run School.ensure()>>\
<<if Player.isYounger()>>\
<<if School.isSchoolDay()>>\
You are outside of Linkon University. The clock tower reads <<= World.formatTime()>>.<<if !World.isBefore(7, 0) && World.isBefore(9, 0)>> Class starts at <<= World.formatTimeAt(9, 0)>>.<</if>>
<<if School.isCalebWaitingWindow()>>\
<<gap>>
<<important>><<Caleb>> will be waiting outside the gates around <<= World.formatTimeAt(15, 0)>> — don't keep <<him>> too long.<</important>>
<</if>>\
<<set _outside to School.campusRooms("outside")>>\
<<set _facilities to School.campusRooms("facilities")>>\
<<set _classrooms to School.campusRooms("classrooms")>>\
<<set _attend to School.gatePeriod()>>\
<<if _attend>>\
<<gap>>
<<schoolIcon _attend.icon>><<link `_attend.attendLabel + " <span class='action-time'>(0:" + String(_attend.minutes).padStart(2, "0") + ")</span>"` `_attend.passage`>><<run World.advance(_attend.minutes)>><</link>><br>\
<</if>>\
<<gap>>
Outside
<<for _r range _outside>>\
<<schoolIcon _r.icon>><<link `_r.label + " <span class='action-time'>(0:" + String(_r.minutes).padStart(2, "0") + ")</span>"` `_r.passage`>><<run World.advance(_r.minutes)>><</link>><br>\
<</for>>\

Facilities
<<for _r range _facilities>>\
<<schoolIcon _r.icon>><<link `_r.label + " <span class='action-time'>(0:" + String(_r.minutes).padStart(2, "0") + ")</span>"` `_r.passage`>><<run World.advance(_r.minutes)>><</link>><br>\
<</for>>\

Classrooms
<<for _r range _classrooms>>\
<<schoolIcon _r.icon>><<link `_r.label + " <span class='action-time'>(0:" + String(_r.minutes).padStart(2, "0") + ")</span>"` `_r.passage`>><<run World.advance(_r.minutes)>><</link>><br>\
<</for>>\
<<else>>\
Campus is quiet on the weekend. The gates are open, but classrooms sit dark behind locked doors.
<</if>>\
<<else>>\
You arrive at Linkon University. Students move between buildings with backpacks and coffee cups. It makes you nostalgic thinking about your younger years here...
<</if>>
<<actionIcon "exit">><<link "Leave the school <span class='action-time'>(0:02)</span>">><<run World.advance(2)>><<goto "Campus Front Courtyard">><</link>>
